xt":"On the 2nd lap Varzi passed Minozzi for the lead with Farina still third, followed by Trossi, Nuvolari, Brivio and Balestrero.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":4,"text":"On the 4th lap Trossi passed Farina for third place and then attacked Minozzi in 2nd position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":4,"text":"Nuvolari, with poor tyre grip and a broken rear shock absorber, skids off the track and falls to last. Brivio's Bugatti is circulating slowly.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":5,"text":"On the 5th lap Trossi caught Minozzi and passed him for 2nd place. The two Scuderia Ferrari Alfa Romeos were now in front and drove a cat and mouse game.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":12,"text":"On the 12th lap Trossi passed Varzi for the lead","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":14,"text":"Varzi retakes the lead from Trossi with a 1m31s lap.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":15,"text":"Farina catches and passes Minozzi, who retires with engine problems.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":25,"text":"Trossi passes Varzi again for the lead. Nuvolari retires after a pit stop.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":28,"text":"On the 28th lap, Varzi again passed Trossi.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":29,"text":"On the 29th lap the Biellese was again ahead of Varzi.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Varzi settles in behind his Scuderia president Trossi.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":40,"text":"On the last lap, in full view of the finish, Trossi slowed down and waited until Varzi was level with him. Trossi crossed the finish line as the winner no more than the width of a wheel ahead of Varzi.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"Farina is third and first of the 1500 cc cars; Brivio fourth, Balestrero fifth.","q":false,"c":2}]}